.Dd August 1, 2026
.Dt INTEGRIS-ASSURE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm integris-assure
.Nd validate Integris assurance records and traceability matrix
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm validate
.Op Fl -root Ar dir
.Nm
.Cm trace
.Op Fl -root Ar dir
.Cm --check | --write
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is assurance tooling for the Integris repository.
It validates machine-readable assurance records and renders or checks the
human-readable traceability matrix.
It is not product replication code and performs no archive mutation or
network I/O.
.Ss Commands
.Bl -tag -width "validate"
.It Cm validate
Load and validate
.Pa assurance/requirements.json ,
.Pa assurance/hazards.json ,
.Pa assurance/threats.json ,
.Pa assurance/verifications.json ,
and
.Pa assurance/evidence.json .
Checks include identifier shape, required fields, bidirectional references,
criticality classes IC-1 through IC-4, and existence of cited specification
paths.
Produced evidence locations are verified when applicable.
.It Cm trace
Generate the Markdown traceability matrix for
.Pa docs/traceability.md .
Exactly one of
.Cm --check
or
.Cm --write
is required:
.Bl -tag -width "--write" -compact
.It Cm --check
Compare generated output to the checked-in file; fail if they differ.
.It Cm --write
Overwrite
.Pa docs/traceability.md
with generated content.
.El
.El
.Ss Options
.Bl -tag -width "--root dir"
.It Fl -root Ar dir
Repository root containing
.Pa assurance/
and
.Pa docs/
(default: current directory).
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "docs/traceability.md" -compact
.It Pa assurance/*.json
Normative assurance inputs.
.It Pa docs/traceability.md
Generated matrix checked by
.Cm trace --check .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Validation or check succeeded.
.It 1
Validation, I/O, or freshness failure.
.It 2
Usage error or unknown command.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
integris-assure validate --root .
integris-assure trace --root . --check
integris-assure trace --root . --write
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr integris-evidence 1 ,
.Xr make 1 ,
.Xr integris 7
.Pp
.Pa assurance/README.md ,
.Pa docs/assurance-case.md
.Sh HISTORY
Part of the Integris M0 assurance baseline tooling.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Integris contributors
.Sh CAVEATS
A successful validation does not mean evidence is complete or that a release
is authorized.
.Dq planned
evidence remains a declared gap.
